    "markdown": "# Computer Science > Discrete Mathematics\n\n    A newer version of this paper has been withdrawn by Jesse Gilbert D\n    \n            Abstract:  We show the Graceful Tree Conjecture holds.\n    \n\n    \n    \n  \n\n  [Submitted on 14 Sep 2007 (v1), revised 14 Jan 2009 (this version, v8), \n\n    *latest version 29 Jul 2010*(v9)]\n# Title:A complete proof of The Graceful Tree Conjecture using the concept of Edge Degree\n\nView PDF HTML (experimental)\n            Abstract:  We show the Graceful Tree Conjecture holds.\n    \n\n## Submission history\n\nFrom: Jesse Gilbert D [view email]\n**[v1]**Fri, 14 Sep 2007 17:31:22 UTC (4 KB)\n\n**[v2]**Mon, 17 Sep 2007 04:35:57 UTC (4 KB)\n\n**[v3]**Tue, 18 Sep 2007 21:18:17 UTC (3 KB)\n\n**[v4]**Thu, 20 Sep 2007 01:21:11 UTC (3 KB)\n\n**[v5]**Fri, 21 Sep 2007 21:44:44 UTC (3 KB)\n\n**[v6]**Fri, 5 Oct 2007 10:14:01 UTC (3 KB)\n\n**[v7]**Tue, 13 May 2008 22:41:41 UTC (4 KB)\n\n**[v8]**Wed, 14 Jan 2009 00:46:23 UTC (13 KB)\n\n**[v9]**Thu, 29 Jul 2010 20:46:42 UTC (1 KB)\n\n*(withdrawn)*\n\n### References & Citations\n\n    \n    Loading...\n\n# Bibliographic and Citation Tools\n\n            Bibliographic Explorer \n\n        *(What is the Explorer?)*\n            Connected Papers \n\n        *(What is Connected Papers?)*\n            Litmaps \n\n        *(What is Litmaps?)*\n            scite Smart Citations \n\n        *(What are Smart Citations?)*\n# Code, Data and Media Associated with this Article\n\n            alphaXiv \n\n        *(What is alphaXiv?)*\n            CatalyzeX Code Finder for Papers \n\n        *(What is CatalyzeX?)*\n            DagsHub \n\n        *(What is DagsHub?)*\n            Gotit.pub \n\n        *(What is GotitPub?)*\n            Hugging Face \n\n        *(What is Huggingface?)*\n            ScienceCast \n\n        *(What is ScienceCast?)*\n# Demos\n\n# Recommenders and Search Tools\n\n              Influence Flower \n\n          *(What are Influence Flowers?)*\n              CORE